    description: "Thornbacks circle close and throw spines while the rammers charge. Four [[part:thorn_gun|thorn guns]] take a shield down fast, but they reach only a short way: keep your distance. Two [[part:grown_ganglion|ganglions]] run it, and the [[part:grown_heart|heart]] between the guns and them grows it back.",
